title: The Resignation Threat
subtitle: Levi and Zetkin will go if they lose. Should the committee know it?
view-if: congress_cc21 = 1 and congress_closing = 0 and e21_cc_mode = 1 and congress_used_walkout = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.congress_used_walkout = 1;
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}
frequency: 300
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= The Resignation Threat

Levi has made up his mind. If Rákosi's resolution passes, he will resign the chair, and Zetkin, Däumig, Hoffmann and Brass will resign with him. Some members of the committee would vote differently if they knew. Some would vote differently because they knew.

- @announce: Announce it before the vote.
- @zetkin: Let Clara Zetkin speak instead.
- @keep: Keep it to ourselves.

@announce
subtitle: Many will not risk losing half the Zentrale. Others resent being threatened.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway(0.08 + Math.random() * 0.04);
RG.congress.bitter(4);
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 4;
!}

Levi tells the committee plainly: the resolution or the Zentrale. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] members who were going to vote with Rákosi think again. ?] Frölich says that the party has never before been blackmailed by its own chairman.

@zetkin
subtitle: The old woman of the movement, not the chairman, pleads for the majority of the workers.
choose-if: comrade_zetkin = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Zetkin is not here to speak.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway(0.05 + Math.random() * 0.05);
RG.congress.bitter(-1);
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 3;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Clara Zetkin speaks for half an hour about Italy, where she has never been, and about the masses, whom she has known for forty years. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] members come over. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : She is applauded, and the votes stay where they were. ?]

@keep
subtitle: No threats. The committee votes on Italy, not on Levi.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.bitter(-2);
Q.unity += 2;
!}

Levi says nothing about what he will do. The committee will find out afterwards.
